--[[
    HunterAim v10 (survivor, asset-driven, whitelisted, ability-aware prediction)
    - Auto-detects the survivor you're playing
    - Reads ability anim + sound ids from ReplicatedStorage.Assets
    - Reads Config.Sounds, Config.Sound, Config.SFX, Config.Sfx,
      Config.SoundEffects, Config.SoundIds (all variants merged)
    - Aims ONLY on:
        * Shedletsky  → Slash
        * Chance      → Shoot (AimGun / GunFire / GunExplode / GunFail)
        * Two Time    → Stab  (Stab / LungeStart / Lunge)
    - Prediction:
        * Ping prediction only applies to Chance (ranged)
        * Shed slash + Two Time stab use velocity-only lead
    - Targets the nearest killer
]]

